Platon. Le Sophiste. Traduction et présentation par Néstor-Luis Cordero. Paris: Flammarion, 1993. French. ISBN 9782080706874.

[Edition in the Strasbourg public-library catalogue](https://www.mediatheques.strasbourg.eu/doc/IGUANA_2/254533/le-sophiste). This translated commentary is named in the [UNICAMP graduate bibliography](Academic-benchmarks.lingua#r_7YDPSHERTRH41D7YR4P93PWNEP).

Use the complete dialogue and commentary for [being, difference, and falsehood](../research/seminars/Plato-being-and-knowledge.lingua#r_34WRXN1SRY8SZVRKRV7X3X9QWA), alongside an identified Greek edition. Compare the interpretation with a serious alternative and trace the disagreement to the actual passages.

**Access:** library or an owned edition. A justified scholarly equivalent can serve the same role when it addresses the selected dispute at the required depth.
